  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "Evidence: config_001 (RNA-only, pca_n2000) achieved 0.485 acc, and config_016 (multimodal, pca_n2000 + resnet50, concat) achieved 0.527 acc, a +4.2 pp gain. However, we cannot yet decompose whether this gain comes from the image modality alone or from a genuine synergistic combination. Uncertainty: We lack an image-only baseline with the same resnet50 encoder, so we cannot attribute the multimodal improvement to either modality or to interaction. This experiment (config_010: image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) isolates the image contribution by holding the image encoder and profile setting constant while removing RNA. It is the best next step because it directly decomposes the multimodal gain, informs whether further multimodal complexity (fusion variants, multiprofile aggregation) is warranted, and is a single-variable comparison to both prior experiments—maximizing information per experiment under the limited budget."
}

